ana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-indent: 13.3pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2차 인증 로그인 화면 새로고침(F5), 금오공대 </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-indent: 13.3pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">앱을 재설치 해주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><br></p><p></p></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">시행일  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">: 2021. 1. 7.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span>\n</div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">정&nbsp; 보&nbsp; 전&nbsp; 산&nbsp; 원</span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-indent: 17.7333px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></p><hr style=\"display:block; border: black 0 none; border-top: black 1px solid; height: 1px\"><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br></p></span></div><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&lt; 2차 인증 로그인&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">방법 안내 &gt;</span></b></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; text-indent: 13.3pt; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-indent: 13.3pt; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">방법 1 : 금오공대 앱 이용</span><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold;\">금오공대 앱 설치 또는 업데이트&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">로그인 필수</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">설치 방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: PlayStore&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">또는&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">AppStore</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">에서&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">“</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">금오공대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">검색하여 설치 및 로그인</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">업데이트 방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">앱 종료 후 실행</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px; text-indent: -28px;\">※&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">인증이&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">정상적으로 안되는 경우 금오공대 앱 삭제 후 재설치</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 21pt; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 17.7333px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 21pt; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 17.7333px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">2.</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 17.7333px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: 17.7333px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold;\">원스톱서비스 또는 종합정보시스템에 접속</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 21pt; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -21pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-indent: 17.7333px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-indent: 17.7333px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span>-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -21pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">통합로그인 페이지에서 아이디 로그인&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -21pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">---- 1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -21pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">차 인증</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -28px; margin-left: 21pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-indent: 17.7333px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span>-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">금오공대 앱에서 알림을 수신하여 지문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">안면</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">패턴 인증 후 확인&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">---- 2</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">차 인증</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -28px; margin-left: 21pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span></font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><b>※&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">인터넷 익스플로러</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">에서 알림 발송이 안될 시&nbsp;F5를 눌러 새로고침</span></b></span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 21pt; text-indent: -21pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-indent: 17.7333px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">스마트폰에 따라 지원하는 인증방법(</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">지문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">안면</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">패턴)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -21pt;\">이 다름</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"16336\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-indent: 17.7333px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><img src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHoSgVB5AQgGXgDQFYHMBqBhAZwGkAHARwBtYAxAWwDkB3AOhIDssg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 13.3pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">방법 2 : 공동인증서 이용 (PC에서만 가능)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -21pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">1. 원스톱서비스 또는 종합정보시스템에 접속</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 21pt; text-indent: -21pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbs